Package: spooles
Version: 2.2
Architecture: riscv64
Maintainer: Gurleen Kansray <your@email.com>
Description: SPOOLES sparse linear algebra library — riscv64 cross-compiled
 SPOOLES is a library for solving sparse real and complex linear systems
 of equations. Cross-compiled for riscv64 with -fcommon fix for GCC 10+.
 Part of LFX RISC-V HPC porting effort.
Depends: libc6
